  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんと！
すべての精霊を従えたのか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What!? Really!?
You've got all the spirits!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こ、これはすさまじい
宣伝になったわい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-That'll make for truly
incredible advertising!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、本当にありがとう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Truly, thank you so much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前さんらにうさギルドの栄誉称号
うさギルダーを授与しよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll confer upon you an honorary
Bunny Guild title, "Bunny Guilder."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もうそんなモンと、感謝の言葉しか
ないんじゃが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But between that and words of
gratitude, that's all I have...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう一度言わせてくれい。
本当に、ありがとう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll say it once more.
Truly, thank you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>5</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うーん……
かわいらしすぎるんで
オレは遠慮しようかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, uhh... It's kinda a bit
too cutesy for me, so,
uh...you can keep it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかの？
このふぁんしーさがわからんとは
まだまだじゃのお</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? I guess you're still a
little too young to appreciate
the finer things in life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さて、この世界での役目を終えたし、
そろそろダングレストに戻るかの～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then, I've finished what
I came to this world for, so I
should get back to Dahngrest...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>時空転移用の井戸は、っと……
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;じゃったかの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That dimension-hopping well
was in... &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;, wasn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おっと！　なんでもないぞい？
今のは聞かなかったことに
しといてくれぃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oops! Pretend you
didn't hear what I
said just now, okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふおっふおっふおっ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ho ho ho...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
